{"v":4,"catch":"試試建立和經營最可愛的森林咖啡館吧！","desc":"是時候在森林空地上照顧可愛的動物並為牠們建造一個舒適的咖啡館了。準備好接待工作。將各種美味的菜餚和飲料添加到菜單中。\n\n設置工作，使得沒有任何動物需要等太久，否則牠們會不高興。雇用和培訓員工。讓你的咖啡館成為森林中最受歡迎的地方！\n\n來看看 NOSTRA.GAMES 團隊的新有趣遊戲吧。\n\n準備好在森林咖啡館迎接你的小朋友們吧。","publisher":"NOSTRA GAMES","release":"2025-04-03","genres":["模擬","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.4GB / Switch 0.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4d8fc55b4e149fe0e82c2d175cba508a0ecbb0b76cb3bef188d2f00c6c9c787a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2d1b009c284510af37f9faf305501ac7817b248c1276451bed4845a5e138a3d4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/81b7be39e89768b060e03bab31859dde17e6847697f3b5920caea941c69795f7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/999b09bf72f0676663ba811b353a64ecc834103c7c2da5b1469bf8864c83ff02.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e73b35176c3dcf163bdef0054fa3247b7e57ba40286c04a558e4c718f6c3070a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/eeace77a204b3c8db98ec31ca9dcffcdbad5645c4e2b70233bf9677affb3136c.jpg"],"titleId":"01007be022878000","dlc":[]}